{"id": "mail-0023", "source_type": "mail", "external_id": "<s07-i1-mailA@mail.example.test>", "title": "계약 단가 안내", "content": "협력사 가상물류와의 계약 단가는 건당 1,200원입니다. 재무팀 내부용입니다.\n", "author": "seoa.lee@example.test", "participants": ["seoa.lee@example.test"], "thread_id": "thr-s07-i1-mailA", "source_url": "https://mail.example.test/msg/s07-i1-mailA", "created_at": "2026-11-02T10:00:00+09:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-02T10:00:00+09:00", "content_hash": "sha256:2a1f96bbbe4d5896c74bdfb62af8f888f2ea9be7c2fe4e330ae7b3d4361a02f0", "version": 1, "access_scope": ["group:finance-team", "user:seoa.lee"], "metadata": {}, "connector_instance_id": "conn-mail-01", "operation": "upsert", "schema_version": "1"}
