{"id": "mail-0041", "source_type": "mail", "external_id": "<s11-i3-mailE@mail.example.test>", "title": "연말 휴무 안내", "content": "연말 휴무는 2026-12-31부터 2027-01-01까지입니다.\n", "author": "hr-bot@example.test", "participants": ["all-staff@example.test"], "thread_id": "thr-s11-i3-mailE", "source_url": "https://mail.example.test/msg/s11-i3-mailE", "created_at": "2026-11-10T09:00:00+09:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-10T09:00:00+09:00", "content_hash": "sha256:cc2f5cacf666e9ce9fea023c8d7b0dcf6cf9eac5dd64679095e3625559d7a7cd", "version": 1, "access_scope": ["org:all"], "metadata": {}, "connector_instance_id": "conn-mail-01", "operation": "upsert", "schema_version": "1"}
{"id": "mail-0042", "source_type": "mail", "external_id": "<s02-i4-mailD@mail.example.test>", "title": "점검표 반영본", "content": "정하린 님께,\n\n정산팀 점검표 반영본을 첨부합니다. 같은 정산팀 소속이라 바로 공유드립니다.\n\n오세훈 드림\n", "author": "sehun.oh@example.test", "participants": ["sehun.oh@example.test", "harin.jung1@example.test"], "thread_id": "thr-s02-i4-mailD", "source_url": "https://mail.example.test/msg/s02-i4-mailD", "created_at": "2026-11-19T10:00:00+09:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-19T10:00:00+09:00", "content_hash": "sha256:445b614ce63612ffc343cfc4ae2b7f85c497e5fb6f6be8f0029e69897085359f", "version": 1, "access_scope": ["org:all"], "metadata": {}, "connector_instance_id": "conn-mail-01", "operation": "upsert", "schema_version": "1"}
{"id": "mail-0043", "source_type": "mail", "external_id": "<s04-i4-mailB@mail.example.test>", "title": "고객 포털 오픈 안내", "content": "고객 포털 개편은 2026-12-21에 오픈합니다. 담당은 한유진입니다.\n", "author": "yujin.han@example.test", "participants": ["yujin.han@example.test", "all-dev@example.test"], "thread_id": "thr-s04-i4-mailB", "source_url": "https://mail.example.test/msg/s04-i4-mailB", "created_at": "2026-11-12T10:00:00+09:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-12T10:00:00+09:00", "content_hash": "sha256:71e0e553846ec5079149741bcebfd90711bc9d6eb3c01331554564ce06569383", "version": 1, "access_scope": ["org:all"], "metadata": {}, "connector_instance_id": "conn-mail-01", "operation": "upsert", "schema_version": "1"}
{"id": "mail-0044", "source_type": "mail", "external_id": "<s05-i4-mailA@mail.example.test>", "title": "신규 요금 안내", "content": "신규 요금 안내는 2026-12-01부터 적용됩니다.\n", "author": "yuna.cha@example.test", "participants": ["yuna.cha@example.test"], "thread_id": "thr-s05-i4-price", "source_url": "https://mail.example.test/msg/s05-i4-mailA", "created_at": "2026-11-17T10:00:00+09:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T10:00:00+09:00", "content_hash": "sha256:eaea265de345a87795e2d6b7c57dfab1bac3460e1f677e0a534a3683d0c31efa", "version": 1, "access_scope": ["org:all"], "metadata": {}, "connector_instance_id": "conn-mail-01", "operation": "upsert", "schema_version": "1"}
{"id": "mail-0045", "source_type": "mail", "external_id": "<s05-i4-mailB@mail.example.test>", "title": "Re: 신규 요금 안내", "content": "정정 안내: 신규 요금 적용일은 2026-12-08입니다. 이전 메일의 2026-12-01은 잘못된 날짜였습니다.\n", "author": "yuna.cha@example.test", "participants": ["yuna.cha@example.test"], "thread_id": "thr-s05-i4-price", "source_url": "https://mail.example.test/msg/s05-i4-mailB", "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:00:00+09:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T15:00:00+09:00", "content_hash": "sha256:db491b507dcf2226617e6b6c982f868d53de3323cd9d958dce6e22131cb05629", "version": 1, "access_scope": ["org:all"], "metadata": {}, "connector_instance_id": "conn-mail-01", "operation": "upsert", "schema_version": "1"}
{"id": "mail-0046", "source_type": "mail", "external_id": "<s06-i4-mailC@mail.example.test>", "title": "임시 계정 정리 공지", "content": "임시 계정 정리 사전 공지: 2026-12-05 작업 예정입니다.\n", "author": "woojin.jung@example.test", "participants": ["woojin.jung@example.test", "all-dev@example.test"], "thread_id": "thr-s06-i4-mailC", "source_url": "https://mail.example.test/msg/s06-i4-mailC", "created_at": "2026-11-19T09:00:00+09:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-19T09:00:00+09:00", "content_hash": "sha256:98b1b68be230fa629d3ca6d60104476b485e70a1df8440868159ec030ff7d0b5", "version": 1, "access_scope": ["org:all"], "metadata": {}, "connector_instance_id": "conn-mail-01", "operation": "upsert", "schema_version": "1"}
