{"id": "mail-0049", "source_type": "mail", "external_id": "<s11-i4-mailB@mail.example.test>", "title": "배치 지연 안내", "content": "어젯밤 야간 정산 배치가 20분 늦게 끝났습니다(2026-11-20 03:20 종료). 이후 실행은 정상입니다.\n", "author": "yeonwoo.kang@example.test", "participants": ["yeonwoo.kang@example.test"], "thread_id": "thr-s11-i4-mailB", "source_url": "https://mail.example.test/msg/s11-i4-mailB", "created_at": "2026-11-20T09:00:00+09:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-20T09:00:00+09:00", "content_hash": "sha256:70b9f485b84eb8c6dea8e78fb213dc94948ed0030a51ff78cf7942dbfb9156ea", "version": 1, "access_scope": ["org:all"], "metadata": {}, "connector_instance_id": "conn-mail-01", "operation": "upsert", "schema_version": "1"}
